WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Placeholder film. The founder take goes here.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.500
Clipping is simple. You take the best moments from longer content

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.000
and lots of people post them as short clips on their own accounts.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.500
People scroll past ads. They stop for clips.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.000
Every post is checked before it counts, and you only pay for counted views.
